menu "Flipped Energy Matter"

config FLIPPED_ENERGY_ENDPOINTS
    bool "Electrical utility meter (EP 2) and electrical meter (EP 3) endpoints"
    default y
    help
        Builds EP 2 and EP 3 into the node. With n the switch endpoints start at EP 2. Unpair the device before
        flashing a build with the other setting: the fixed endpoint IDs would collide with the stored switch IDs.

config FLIPPED_GRID_ENERGY_OUTLET
    bool "Grid Energy outlet: a native On/Off Plug-in Unit and Electrical Sensor endpoint carrying the imported energy"
    depends on FLIPPED_ENERGY_ENDPOINTS
    default y
    help
        Creates, after start, an always-off outlet endpoint named Grid Energy under the ID stored in flipped_mtr/grid_ep.
        It carries Electrical Power Measurement (ActivePower null) and Electrical Energy Measurement with the same
        cumulative and periodic imported energy as EP 3, for controllers that count energy only on outlet accessories.

config FLIPPED_EVE_HISTORY
    bool "Eve history cluster 0x130AFC01 on a native Energy History endpoint"
    default n
    help
        Builds route 2 of design 03 section 9.4: an always-off On/Off Plug-in Unit endpoint created after start under
        the ID stored in flipped_mtr/eve_ep, carrying Eve's history cluster over the imported-energy encoder persisted
        in flipped/eve_hist. Off until probe P5 variant A has shown history in the Eve app for this identity.

endmenu
